{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51062","headline":"赠张乖厓 · 陈抟","name":"赠张乖厓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自吴入蜀是寻常，歌舞筵中救火忙。\n乞得金陵养闲散，也须多谢鬓边疮。\n（见《宋诗纪事》卷五。\n）（见《湘山野录》卷上、《梦溪笔谈》卷二十。\n）（〖1〗《古今诗话》：「张忠定公少谒华山陈图南，图南赠诗一绝，始皆不喻其意。\n後忠定更镇杭益，晚年发疮於鬓，移守金陵，遂薨，悉如其言。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}